{"unit_id":"kevindawn11-hash__dsh-cookie-guard#card-zh","repo":"kevindawn11-hash/dsh-cookie-guard","commit":"559052490bf9ccc1989e4b2b824c94833a236325","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cookie-guard 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Desktop 的启动修复插件。它通过 DSH bundle patch 将 connection.cookieMaxAgeDays 设为 7 天，减少随机端口启动后遗留的 dsh-auth-* cookie 累积。另附清理工具，可在退出 DSH 后备份 Cookies 数据库并删除匹配记录，也支持 dry-run 统计和指定数据库路径。适合遇到 HTTP 431 或 Web authentication failed 的桌面端用户；无需 API key，需 Node.js 22 或更新版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:18-20","lib/index.js:4-9","tools/prune-cookies.mjs:8-18"]}
